---
Manage data models

Usage: vendo models [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  list  List all data models
  get   Get model details

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

Global options:
      --profile <name>  Use a specific account profile (or set VENDO_PROFILE)
      --debug           Enable verbose request diagnostics
